00:05:18.155 --> 00:05:19.835
We had decided that

00:05:19.995 --> 00:05:21.595
kind of based on feedback.

00:05:22.075 --> 00:05:26.635
We decided this year that we would separate the budget out into

00:05:26.795 --> 00:05:28.875
different budget building workshops

00:05:29.115 --> 00:05:33.150
with a focus on different content at each of those workshops.

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.590
Began in December.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:35.870
We

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:38.430
had two December 1 and December 15.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:44.030
